    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Erase to Improve: Erasable <span class="search-hit mathjax">Reinforcement</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Learning</span> for Search-Augmented LLMs
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wang%2C+Z">Ziliang Wang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=An%2C+K">Kang An</a>, 
      
