    <p class="abstract mathjax">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Abstract</span>:
      <span class="abstract-short has-text-grey-dark mathjax" id="2510.01076v1-abstract-short" style="display: inline;">
        This article addresses embodied intelligence and <span class="search-hit mathjax">reinforcement</span>&hellip;
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('2510.01076v1-abstract-full').style.display = 'inline'; document.getElementById('2510.01076v1-abstract-short').style.display = 'none';">&#9661; More</a>
      </span>
      <span class="abstract-full has-text-grey-dark mathjax" id="2510.01076v1-abstract-full" style="display: none;">
        This article addresses embodied intelligence and <span class="search-hit mathjax">reinforcement</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">learning</span> integration in the field of text processing, aiming to enhance text handling with more intelligence on the basis of embodied intelligence&#39;s perception and action superiority and <span class="search-hit mathjax">reinforcement</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">learning&#39;s</span> decision optimization capability. Through detailed theoretical explanation and experimental exploration, a novel integration model is introduced. This model has been demonstrated to be very effective in a wide range oftext processing tasks, validating its applicative potential
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('2510.01076v1-abstract-full').style.display = 'none'; document.getElementById('2510.01076v1-abstract-short').style.display = 'inline';">&#9651; Less</a>
      </span>
    </p>
    

